## 🚀 Autonomous Workflow

### 1. **Task Creation**
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[New Task Request] --> B[Priority Assignment]
    B --> C[Dependency Check]
    C --> D[Add to Queue]
    D --> E[State Persistence]
```

### 2. **Task Execution**
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Get Next Task] --> B[Check Dependencies]
    B -->|Met| C[Assign to Agent]
    B -->|Not Met| D[Return to Queue]
    C --> E[Execute Task]
    E --> F[Update Status]
    F --> G[Save State]
```

### 3. **Error Handling**
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Task Failure] --> B[Retry x3]
    B -->|Success| C[Mark Completed]
    B -->|Fail| D[Escalate to Next Agent]
    D --> E[Final Attempt]
    E -->|Success| C
    E -->|Fail| F[Mark Failed]
```

