## 🚀 Launch Instructions

### Quick Start
```bash
# Make launch script executable
chmod +x launch_thoth_swarm.sh

# Launch the swarm
./launch_thoth_swarm.sh
```

### Manual Control
```bash
# Start the automation engine directly
python3 thoth_automation_engine.py

# Add a new task manually
python3 -c "
from thoth_automation_engine import ThothAutomationEngine
engine = ThothAutomationEngine()
engine.add_task('New important task', priority='high')
engine._save_state()
"
```

